  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna insats inneh&#xe5;ller en utv&#xe4;rdering och en effektivitetsgranskning f&#xf6;r att l&#xe4;ra av erfarenheter fr&#xe5;n st&#xf6;det till Karibu Tanzania Organization inf&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rberedelse av ett eventuellt f&#xf6;rnyat st&#xf6;d</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution includes an evaluation and an efficiency audit to learn from the experience of the support to the Karibu Tanzania Organization in order to prepare a possible renewal of the support</narrative>
  </description>
